The generated verb_lemmas.json.gz index was produced by analyzing the
project's existing french_words.txt.gz word list with the Grammalecte French
Hunspell dictionary (version 7.0).

The source French dictionary is copyright its contributors and is distributed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0. Source and license information:
https://grammalecte.net/
https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/MPL/2.0/

The index contains 143,573 normalized forms and stores word-to-lemma
relationships for forms already present in the project's word list.
Regenerate it with:
    python scripts/generate_verb_lemmas.py

When using a different Hunspell dictionary to regenerate the index, update
this notice to identify that dictionary and its applicable license.
